<title>HUNGARY: Hungary prelim March trade surplus $46mln-Cen Bank.</title>
<headline>Hungary prelim March trade surplus $46mln-Cen Bank.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary posted a preliminary $46 million trade surplus in March compared with a deficit of $229 million in February, the National Bank of Hungary said on Friday.  </p>
<p>HUNGARY TRADE DEFICIT (in million dollars)</p>
<p>		    Jan-March 1997   Jan-Feb 1997   Jan-March 1996</p>
<p>    Exports	  4,580	     2,807	  3,091</p>
<p>    Import	   4,972	     3,246	  3,912</p>
<p>    Trade balance   -393		-439	   -821</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327 4040</p>
</text>
